sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PaySvc as Payment Service
    participant PayDB as Payment Local DB (Outbox)
    participant Kafka as Kafka Event Broker
    participant OrdSvc as Order Service (CRASHED for 30s)
    participant OrdDB as Order PostgreSQL DB

    Note over PaySvc, OrdSvc: Scenario: Order Service Outage for 30 Seconds

    PaySvc->>PaySvc: Webhook Received (Payment SUCCESS)
    PaySvc->>PayDB: Local Tx: Update Payment state = CONFIRMED, Insert Outbox Event
    
    PaySvc->>OrdSvc: Direct gRPC Call: createOrder()
    OrdSvc--xPaySvc: Connection Refused (Service Down)
    
    Note over PaySvc: Fallback Triggered: Outbox Retries Active
    
    loop Every 2s (Exponential Backoff)
        PayDB->>Kafka: Outbox Sweeper publishes `salestorm.payment.completed`
        Kafka--xOrdSvc: Delivery Fails (Consumer Group Inactive)
    end

    Note over OrdSvc: T = 30s: Kubernetes Restarts Order Service Pod

    OrdSvc->>Kafka: Re-joins Consumer Group `order-service-group`
    Kafka->>OrdSvc: Delivers Pending Event Offset `salestorm.payment.completed`
    
    OrdSvc->>OrdDB: INSERT INTO orders (reservation_id, status) VALUES ('res_9981', 'CONFIRMED')
    alt Success First Processing
        OrdDB-->>OrdSvc: 1 Row Inserted
    else Duplicate Event (Idempotent Retry)
        OrdDB-->>OrdSvc: ON CONFLICT (reservation_id) DO NOTHING
    end

    OrdSvc->>Kafka: Commit Consumer Offset
    Note over OrdSvc: 100% Recovery Completed with Zero Data Loss
